We finished the tea.
I said goodbye to Amit, Neha, and Sanjay.
"Bye!"
"Let's meet next Thursday!"
I said to them.
"Bye Maya!"
"Take care!" they said.
I walked to the nearby bus stop.
My regular BEST bus arrived soon.
There was not much crowd in the bus.
I boarded the bus.
I gave the ticket money to the conductor dada.
Luckily, I got a window seat.
I looked outside through the window.
I thought about my first days in Mumbai.
In January, I came to this city for the first time.
In that first week, I felt very scared.
But Asha and Rohan helped me a lot.
And now I have found these nice new friends.
I smiled contentedly.
Now this city truly feels like my home.
